=== Part B: same steps with a SAVEPOINT ===
BEGIN
INSERT 0 1
SAVEPOINT
psql:02_rollback_overpayment.sql:49: ERROR:  Payment of 15750000.00 NGN would exceed invoice 119 (amount 15750000.00, already paid 7875000.00)
CONTEXT:  PL/pgSQL function fn_payment_within_invoice() line 13 at RAISE
ROLLBACK
>>> Rolled back to the savepoint; the transaction is usable again
COMMIT
